── SYNTAX ERROR ───────────────────────── E0100_prefixed_string.lt:3:10  [E0100]

Stilt's strings take no `f` before them:

  3 │   print(f"hello {name}")
    │          ^^^^^^^^

Every string inserts the value of each `{…}` in it, as `"hello {name}"`, and
`{{` writes a brace.

To fix it, delete the prefix:

  3 │   print(f"hello {name}")
    │         -
